Package: SCProkaR
Title: Microbial Single-Cell RNA-Seq Analysis for Bacterial Systems
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jinxin", "Zhao", , "jinxin.zhao@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a SingleCellExperiment-centered workflow for microbial
    single-cell RNA-seq analysis. The package standardizes bacterial input
    objects, computes quality-control metrics including rRNA fractions,
    performs batch integration with multiple backends, benchmarks integrated
    embeddings with scIB-inspired metrics, builds PAGA-inspired trajectory
    graphs, and supports pseudobulk and time-series differential expression.
